 {id:"u121a",title:"Long journeys, part 1",items:[["Recorrimos la península de Yucatán en carro.","We drove around the Yucatán peninsula."],["Viajamos de mochilazo por Centroamérica.","We went backpacking around Central America."],["Para cruzar la frontera necesitas pasaporte y visa.","To cross the border you need a passport and a visa."],["Dormimos en hostales para ahorrar.","We slept in hostels to save money."],["Contratamos un seguro de viaje por si acaso.","We took out travel insurance just in case."],["El tren de Chihuahua al Pacífico pasa por la Barranca del Cobre.","The Chihuahua to Pacific train goes through the Copper Canyon."],["Cambiamos dólares en una casa de cambio.","We changed dollars at a bureau de change."],["Hicimos escala en Panamá.","We had a stopover in Panama."],["Llevábamos tres semanas viajando y ya extrañábamos la casa.","We’d been travelling for three weeks and we already missed home."]]}
