 {id:"u135a",title:"Paperwork, part 1",items:[["Tengo que renovar mi pasaporte antes del viaje.","I have to renew my passport before the trip."],["Saqué cita en línea para tramitar la credencial.","I booked an appointment online to apply for the ID card."],["Me pidieron acta de nacimiento y comprobante de domicilio.","They asked me for a birth certificate and proof of address."],["El trámite tarda entre diez y quince días hábiles.","The procedure takes between ten and fifteen working days."],["Hay que pagar los derechos en el banco.","You have to pay the fee at the bank."],["Llené el formulario, pero me faltó una firma.","I filled in the form, but I was missing a signature."],["Necesito una copia certificada del documento.","I need a certified copy of the document."],["Me mandaron de una oficina a otra toda la mañana.","They sent me from one office to another all morning."],["Por fin me entregaron mi licencia nueva.","They finally gave me my new licence."]]}
