 {id:"u136a",title:"Materials and objects, part 1",items:[["La mesa es de madera de pino.","The table is made of pine wood."],["Prefiero las bolsas de tela a las de plástico.","I prefer cloth bags to plastic ones."],["Mi abuela tenía una olla de cobre muy antigua.","My grandmother had a very old copper pot."],["Los vasos de vidrio se rompen fácilmente.","Glass tumblers break easily."],["Compré unos aretes de plata en Taxco.","I bought some silver earrings in Taxco."],["La silla es ligera pero muy resistente.","The chair is light but very strong."],["Esta caja de cartón está llena de fotos viejas.","This cardboard box is full of old photos."],["La superficie es lisa y brillante.","The surface is smooth and shiny."],["Ese anillo era de mi bisabuela.","That ring belonged to my great-grandmother."]]}
